    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/247d3a455739d4d272d81776f0c042a2.avif?t=1750962660\" data-has-big width=800 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Save</u></strong> endangered wildlife and balance the needs of your adopted sea creatures to cultivate a thriving animal sanctuary farm, with over 50+ unlockable species to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/e57dd19494fbd88d7e2753e5d9ac22d8.poster.avif?t=1750962660\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/e57dd19494fbd88d7e2753e5d9ac22d8.webm?t=1750962660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/e57dd19494fbd88d7e2753e5d9ac22d8.mp4?t=1750962660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Befriend</strong></u>\u00a0your underwater neighbors to grow your farm, take part in local traditions, or dive into romance with the town's most eligible sea-dwellers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/b2f9382ac1078ac9b4ef128ba980632c.poster.avif?t=1750962660\" width=634 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/b2f9382ac1078ac9b4ef128ba980632c.webm?t=1750962660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/b2f9382ac1078ac9b4ef128ba980632c.mp4?t=1750962660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Fight</u></strong> through the deepest zones of the ocean to gather rare resources, rescue infected animals, and uncover the mysteries at the heart of your magical world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/a533c4e649aec1693396359b905c25ed.poster.avif?t=1750962660\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/a533c4e649aec1693396359b905c25ed.webm?t=1750962660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/a533c4e649aec1693396359b905c25ed.mp4?t=1750962660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Customize</strong></u> everything from your home to your character's appearance, with a wide range of expressive aesthetic options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/1c19144837a8e68c731df59450da7029.poster.avif?t=1750962660\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/1c19144837a8e68c731df59450da7029.webm?t=1750962660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/1c19144837a8e68c731df59450da7029.mp4?t=1750962660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/247d3a455739d4d272d81776f0c042a2.avif?t=1750962660\" data-has-big width=800 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Save</u></strong> endangered wildlife and balance the needs of your adopted sea creatures to cultivate a thriving animal sanctuary farm, with over 50+ unlockable species to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/e57dd19494fbd88d7e2753e5d9ac22d8.poster.avif?t=1750962660\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/e57dd19494fbd88d7e2753e5d9ac22d8.webm?t=1750962660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/e57dd19494fbd88d7e2753e5d9ac22d8.mp4?t=1750962660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Befriend</strong></u>\u00a0your underwater neighbors to grow your farm, take part in local traditions, or dive into romance with the town's most eligible sea-dwellers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/b2f9382ac1078ac9b4ef128ba980632c.poster.avif?t=1750962660\" width=634 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/b2f9382ac1078ac9b4ef128ba980632c.webm?t=1750962660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/b2f9382ac1078ac9b4ef128ba980632c.mp4?t=1750962660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Fight</u></strong> through the deepest zones of the ocean to gather rare resources, rescue infected animals, and uncover the mysteries at the heart of your magical world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/a533c4e649aec1693396359b905c25ed.poster.avif?t=1750962660\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/a533c4e649aec1693396359b905c25ed.webm?t=1750962660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/a533c4e649aec1693396359b905c25ed.mp4?t=1750962660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Customize</strong></u> everything from your home to your character's appearance, with a wide range of expressive aesthetic options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/1c19144837a8e68c731df59450da7029.poster.avif?t=1750962660\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/1c19144837a8e68c731df59450da7029.webm?t=1750962660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069520/extras/1c19144837a8e68c731df59450da7029.mp4?t=1750962660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Build the cozy merfolk life of your dreams in the quirky underwater village of Siren Sands. Manage an animal sanctuary, care for 50+ unlockable creatures, embrace local traditions, find love, and explore dangerous caverns to uncover ancient mysteries.",
